      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 주, 죽는 줄 알았다아…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "し、死ぬかと思ったぁ…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 3,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 아파요… 힘들어요… 발목도 시큰거리고 피부도 다 까졌어요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "痛いし、疲れました…足もズキズキするし、お肌もボロボロです…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 4,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 저희, 이긴 거 맞죠…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私たち、勝ったんですよね…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 5,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "우리가 이겼어.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "うん、勝ったよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 어떻게 이겼는지도 기억이 안 나요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "どうやって勝ったのかも覚えてません…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 아까 우물에서 나오신 그 분, 정말 죽일 생각밖에 없었다니까요?!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "さっき井戸から出てきたあの方、ものすごい殺気でしたよね！？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 눈빛부터가 달랐어요… 눈을 마주치자마자 머리는 하얘지고, 오금은 저리고!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "目つきからして普通じゃなかったです…目が合った瞬間、頭が真っ白になって、膝がガクガクして…！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "저번부터 든 생각인데, 베라.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "ベラ、前から思ってたけど…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 엣, 네, 단장님?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ど、どうしましたか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "너 나한테만 엄청 투덜거리지 않아?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "私の前だと、思ったこと全部口に出すよね？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "다른 사람한테는 티 잘 안 내잖아.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "他の人にはそういうとこ見せないのに。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 으에, 그, 그런가요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふえっ！そ、そうですかね？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 끄응…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うぅん…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 그게… 사실 제가 스승님한테 하던 버릇이었는데요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "それが、実は…師匠にも同じようなことをしていたんです…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 아마 단장님이 스승님이랑 분위기가 비슷해서 저도 모르게… 에헤헤…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長と師匠は雰囲気が似てるので、つい…えへへ…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "기쁜걸.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "嬉しいよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "EmotionEffect": "QMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 네, 네? 기쁘시다구요…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "え、ええっ？嬉しい…ですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "나한테 의지해준다는 거니까.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "私を信じてくれてるってことだから。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그게 그렇게도 되나요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そういうことですかね…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " …네, 맞는 것 같아요. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "確かに…団長の言うとおりだと思います。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 저의 두번째 스승님이 되어주셔서 고마워요, 단장님!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長。第二の師匠になってくださって、ありがとうございます！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 23,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나는 잠시 그녀의 환한 얼굴을 바라보았다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私は、しばらく彼女の眩しい笑顔を見つめていた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "수많은 시련과 상처를 딛고 마침내 <color=#F7BE45>[여정]</color>의 끝에 도달한 자.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "幾多の試練と痛みを克服し、ついに<color=#F7BE45>「救援の旅」</color>の終わりに到達した者。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 25,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그녀의 앞에는 더욱 많은 고난과 어려움이 기다리고 있을 것이다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "彼女には、更なる苦悩と困難が待ち受けているはずだ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 26,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 나는 믿는다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "しかし、私は信じよう。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그녀는 분명 나를 뛰어넘을…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "彼女ならきっと、私を超え…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
